#sortorder:12
#showas:吵闹的邻居
This moderate scenario features the Vanguard AI type (diff 6) which uses guardians in place of its strikecraft. 

Many Neinzul will be encountered in this galaxy. Two Wild Hives will compete for resources, including your own metal harvesters. The Neinzul Custodians are in the midst of their own dispute but not all will be adversarial. Finally, a Neinzul Migrant fleet will offer us power in exchange for safe escort.